  "abiVersion": 1,
  "sequentialJustification": {
    "kind": "pure-transform",
    "detail": "The status node is a pure transform from one run event to one canonical non-size-prefixed FSB envelope carrying a single size-prefixed DSS record. There is no collection to partition and no worker pool to size; a thread here could only reorder status events, which the APP status routes read as an ordered sequence."
  }
